  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine oats, coconut milk beverage, Greek yogurt, chia seeds, and 1 tablespoon coconut flakes in an 8-ounce Mason jar. Stir until well combined, and cover with a lid. Refrigerate for 8 hours, or overnight.",
